  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pas 305.10 New Installation Operation Restrictions. New installations shall be put into service for use by the general public only after testing and issuance of a registration.\n\nSource. #7800, eff 12-11-02; amd by #9354-B, eff 1-3-09; ss by #10072, eff 1-11-12; amd by #10382, eff 7-23-13); ss by#13429-B, eff 8-6-22 (formerly Pas 305.07)",
